{"format":{"$defs":{"TextReading":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"corrected_text":{"maxLength":6000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"coverage":{"const":"complete"},"paragraph_alias":{"enum":["P1"],"pattern":"^P([1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[0-2])$","title":"Paragraph Alias","type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"null"}},"required":["paragraph_alias","coverage","corrected_text","reason"],"title":"TextReading","type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"corrected_text":{"type":"null"},"coverage":{"const":"incomplete"},"paragraph_alias":{"enum":["P1"],"pattern":"^P([1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[0-2])$","title":"Paragraph Alias","type":"string"},"reason":{"maxLength":1000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["paragraph_alias","coverage","corrected_text","reason"],"title":"TextReading","type":"object"}]}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"contract":{"const":"ocr-productive-repair-text-reply-v3","title":"Contract","type":"string"},"readings":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TextReading"},"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"title":"Readings","type":"array"},"unit_id":{"const":"X13"}},"required":["contract","unit_id","readings"],"title":"TextReply","type":"object"},"messages":[{"content":"Inspect the complete assigned target paragraphs against the registered image, including all numbers, names, genuine hyphens, unflagged words and apparent software successes. Flags are inspection hints, not verified errors. Static text is the guarded software proposal, not truth. Return one full corrected text per target, preserving supported historical writing and literal bracket passages. Never return just a flagged word or context paragraph. Supply no offsets or edit lists. If any target cannot be completely read or remains uncertain, return null text, incomplete coverage and a concrete reason. Return the text-reply-v3 JSON reply using the supplied conformance-v4 schema. No source reading is accepted by this reply. For a complete reading, set coverage to \"complete\", corrected_text to the entire reading, and reason to JSON null (not a string). Do not add a completion comment such as \"No further action required.\" For an incomplete or uncertain reading, set coverage to \"incomplete\", corrected_text to JSON null, and reason to a nonempty explanation. Never provide a complete reading while reporting uncertainty.\n\nSource-boundary rule: If the assigned text ends in a word cut off by the registered crop, return coverage \"incomplete\", corrected_text null, and a concrete reason. Do not infer or append unseen letters from language probability. Preserve supported historical wording and fully visible line continuations; do not silently extend the assigned target beyond the image.\n\nWhen a word is divided across two printed lines solely because the line ends, join its visible parts into one word in the corrected reading. Preserve genuine compound-word hyphens and punctuation dashes. Use the image and the full assigned target to distinguish these cases; do not invent missing letters or continue beyond the assigned target.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context_regions\":[],\"contract\":\"ocr-productive-repair-input-v3\",\"diagnostics\":{\"configuration_sha256\":\"72944a9f33e6a123b18ff09eaa3bc8ac34fa6d182960fa92585385bbc932e229\",\"detector_sha256\":\"0f06e3a8bd1c8b7a14175b5610f3127e05934e138831252d300eb86dbf9a4509\",\"negative_targets\":[],\"signals\":[{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"name_list_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":7,\"raw_quote\":\"H\",\"raw_start\":6,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"0bce2e998e3fb8c95935efe1f9f8605de708573cea33cc251212bd1fb7000029\"},{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"name_list_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":81,\"raw_quote\":\"Govern\",\"raw_start\":75,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"287f60fd0d995f39d6d1c0ea